* Eurorack Input Buffer + Output Driver
* For Qucs-S / ngspice
* 
* Simulation: transient 5ms, AC 10Hz-100kHz
* Input: 10Vpp Eurorack signal, 1kHz sine

* Input signal: 10Vpp, 1kHz
VIN IN 0 SIN(0 5 1k) AC 1

* Input AC coupling + bias to ground
C1 IN BUF_IN 1uF
R_BIAS BUF_IN 0 100k

* Stage 1: Non-inverting unity-gain buffer
* E-source: output between BUF_OUT and 0, controlled by BUF_IN minus BUF_FB1
E1 BUF_OUT 0 BUF_IN BUF_FB1 100k
RFB1 BUF_OUT BUF_FB1 1

* Stage 2: Non-inverting, gain = 1 + RFB2/RG2 = 1 + 10k/10k = 2
E2 AMP_OUT 0 BUF_OUT AMP_FB2 100k
RFB2 AMP_OUT AMP_FB2 10k
RG2 AMP_FB2 0 10k

* Output AC coupling
C2 AMP_OUT LINE_OUT 10uF
RLOAD LINE_OUT 0 10k

* Control statements
.control
tran 1u 5m
plot v(in) v(line_out)
.endc

.end